  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Hydroboration-oxidation of terminal alkenes give primary alcohols. Propene gives propanol. Propanol on oxidation with PCC gives propanal. Propanal undergo nucleophilic addition reaction with methyl magnesium bromide give 2-butanol.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5338f041-4948-41d1-a392-779a0c6acf91.png\" style=\"width: 454px; height: 276px;\" /></p>",
